      "revision": 1351638899,
      "text": "Daniellia oliveri is a species of tree in the family Fabaceae. It is native to tropical West and Central Africa and is commonly known as the African copaiba balsam tree, or the West African copal tree."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Daniellia oliveri",
